/Title (Hello, we are team MINDSCAPE_1 from the Mindscape Academy. Our team consists of three people from different backgrounds :Joe \(22\), Charbel Ghanem \(19\), and Charbel Khalife \(16\), under the guidance of our coach, Christa-Maria Mouaikel. Together, we designed and built our autonomous robot, Lightning McQueen, combining our shared passion for engineering, robotics, and innovation.)
