<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 107 0 R
/E (The Open Challenge run \(race.py\) is built as a state machine with six states: STRAIGHT \(default wall-centering driving\), APPROACHING \(line seen, steering full-lock toward the turn before committing\), TURNING_90 \(full-lock turn for a fixed duration\), CORNER_BACKUP and REVERSING \(wall-avoidance interrupts, described below\), and FINISHING \(post-lap-12 stop sequence\). The robot completes 12 corners \(3 laps\) before stopping and lighting the finish LED.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [7]
>>
