/T (5.6 The Wheel Material Decision  For the wheels, we chose to reprint using the same PLA filament at a higher nozzle temperature rather than switching to TPU/rubber. TPU wasn't available to us at the time, and we were working against a tight deadline, so reprinting with a material we already had on hand and knew how to tune was the faster path to a working fix. )
/E (5.6 The Wheel Material Decision  For the wheels, we chose to reprint using the same PLA filament at a higher nozzle temperature rather than switching to TPU/rubber. TPU wasn't available to us at the time, and we were working against a tight deadline, so reprinting with a material we already had on hand and knew how to tune was the faster path to a working fix. )
/Pg 21 0 R
