/E (We then set the camera-based approach aside and tried a strategy based purely on the two ultrasonic sensors, using a PID controller on the distance readings from both sides to center the robot between the walls. After spending significant time tuning it, this approach never stabilized, and our hardware/weight-distribution problems were still unresolved in parallel. This combination is what pushed us to commit to the physical redesign covered in Section 2. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [1]
