<<
/Title (2. Mobility & Mechanical Design 2.1 Version 1 Our first build used a compact chassis with the camera mounted on a front tower, a chamber on the main deck holding the breadboard and motor driver, and the powerbank placed in a slot at the back of the robot, on top of that chamber. The Raspberry Pi 5 was housed alone in its own chamber. Steering was handled by a micro servo through a plastic linkage, with a single DC motor driving a solid rear axle.)
