613 0 obj
<<
/Title (3.4 Power Supply Power is split across two isolated rails. A Joyroom 10,000 mAh fast-charging powerbank \(rated up to 22.5 W, treated as a hard design constraint\) supplies the entire logic side: the Raspberry Pi 5,camera, both ultrasonic sensors, and the supporting LED/button circuit described below. A separate 4x 18650 Li-ion battery pack \(4 x 3.7V, ~14.8V nominal, ~16.8V full / ~12V cutoff\) supplies the drive side of the vehicle, kept completely isolated from the 5V logic rail to avoid motor current/noise or voltage sag affecting the electronics. The 10,000 mAh powerbank was sized to cover a full competition day of practice plus rounds, with a digital display to monitor remaining charge betweenrounds and fast-charge support to top up quickly during breaks.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 607 0 R
/Next 615 0 R
>>
endobj
