615 0 obj
<<
/Title (3.5 Thermal Management A 5V cooling fan, powered from the logic-side powerbank, provides active cooling for the Raspberry Pi 5. The Pi 5 runs noticeably hotter than previous Pi models under sustained camera-processing load; without active cooling, thermal throttling would slow down frame-processing rate mid-round. In the final design the fan was moved to sit on top of the Pi 5 instead of underneath it, for better airflow.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 613 0 R
/Next 617 0 R
>>
endobj
